CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'tag == cmd->tag'
#574: FILE: drivers/scsi/atari_NCR5380.c:2360:
+		if (target_mask == (1 << scmd_id(cmd)) &&
+		    lun == (u8)cmd->device->lun
 #ifdef SUPPORT_TAGS
+		    && (tag == cmd->tag)
 #endif
 		    ) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

